	"title"		"Open Annihilation"
	"description"		"Open Annihilation's own layout: the sticks, triggers, bumpers, face buttons, D-pad, View, Menu and stick clicks reach the game as the gamepad's own; the right trackpad is the mouse, its click the left button; the left trackpad is the left stick; the back grips send F13 (R4, QUEUE), F14 (R5, FORCE), F15 (L4, ADD) and F16 (L5, groups), which the game reads as the grips."
